development.solution_text:
$y=(x-2)^2$ is $y=x^2$ translated right $2$ units, so the vertex moves from $(0,0)$ to $(2,0)$.
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}]
\begin{axis}[axis lines=middle, xlabel={$x$}, ylabel={$y$}, xmin=-4.5, xmax=5.5, ymin=-1, ymax=9, samples=100, clip=false, axis line style={-{Stealth}}, xtick={-4,-2,2,4}, ytick={2,4,6,8}]
